
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

###

### 3. Gui bai nop hop le - HTTP 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV003",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/SV003"
}

###

### 4. Gui bai nop thieu StudentCode - HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/SV004"
}

###

### 5. Gui bai nop thieu RepositoryUrl - HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV005",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

###

### 6. Gui bai nop voi AssignmentId khong ton tai - HTTP 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV006",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/SV006"
}

###

### 7. Tra cuu bai nop khong ton tai - HTTP 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### 8. Kiem tra SignalR negotiate - HTTP 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 9. Kiem tra sai duong dan Hub - HTTP 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Type: application/json

{}
